=2 Walkthrough
Utilize 15 or more {p:Imprimaturs|Imprimatur} on completed {p:Coalition Assignments|Category:Coalition Assignments}.
* Depending on {q:Fame|Fame|Fame} you will get the cutscene sooner with less Imprimaturs used.
** 15 imps utilized with {q:I'm on a Boat|I'm on a Boat|I'm on a Boat} / {q:Hide and Go Peak|Hide and Go Peak|Hide and Go Peak} quests completed is sufficient for all missions requiring fame.
*** It is also possible to complete missions with zero Imprimaturs spent, but the fame requirement is higher.
* Upon completing that, you also gain the ability to purchase Key Items that allow for participation in {p:Wildskeeper Reives|Wildskeeper Reive}, battling against the {p:Naakuals|Naakual}.
** These can be purchased from {n:Dimmian} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} (E-6).
* Talk to {n:Brenton} for a cutscene to complete the mission and receive the {@k} {k:Dinner invitation}.

